  keepGameObjectEnabled: 1
  keepGameObjectDisabled: 0
  interactText: Talk to the King
  interactOnce: 0
  sentences:
  - You are? Oooh the warrior i was told about.I am the King, you can call me Marcus.
    I was waiting for you. I heard your sword skills are impeccable. Become my right
    hand and we will rule ALL THE KINGDOMS together. Here take this shield. The best
    equipment just for my best soldier.Go to the Enemy Kingdom and slaughter every
    enemy for me.We must RULE all Kingdoms together.Those gems i gave you are an
    early payment for your services. Spend them well , i heard the Equipment store
    has some unique swords you might like.Go to the main gate and start your journey
    when you are ready.Fare well soldier!
  - I said enough.Go to the main gate and start your journey when you are ready.Fare
    well soldier!
  disableInputsInSentence: 01000000
