  sentences:
  - Hello again soldier.You remember me?We talked at the very start of your journey.
    Your mission from now on is to kill all the enemy soldiers.And after that hard
    task you have to kill the enemy king and rule his kingdom. Good luck and dont
    forget you can always return to the main castle,using the small statue.
  - Thats it for now. The gods may be with you. Kill every enemy you see in your
    path.
