  interactText: Talk to Athena
  interactOnce: 0
  sentences:
  - 'Hello my name is Athena! I want to welcome you in our village! These two chests
    behind me have items that will help you in your journey! Your purpose here is
    to serve the Kings commands. Do as he says and you will be remembered in history!
    Go and talk to the the King. '
  - That's it for now! It is time to begin your adventure!
